            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nI was not aware that \"utf8 with BOM\" is a thing. One crucial thing to tell here was to have such file already committed and then 'mini.diff' shows that there is a change in first line: Git tells that there are BOM bytes but they are absent in text. You can see that by executing `:lua MiniDiff.toggle_overlay()` and typing `gg` and `<C-y>` to scroll up.\n\nI'll take a look.",
