            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "@SheffeyG, I've just pushed to a [temporary `backlog` branch](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/tree/backlog) what I think should add the support for BOM bytes. It looks like working on my end, but could you please also verify that it works for you?\n\nNote: there will be explicit BOM bytes shown in reference text during overlay if there is a change in a first line. I think it is reasonable mostly because it *is* a part of a reference text. It is also a part of a buffer, but is made invisible by Neovim itself.",
